[SPEAKER_00]: Mano is basically your... you could say it's your... that's where your intention is.

110
00:11:38,847 --> 00:11:42,371
[SPEAKER_00]: And that's why there's that first verse from the Dhammapada that says,

111
00:11:47,311 --> 00:11:55,233
