113
00:12:00,134 --> 00:12:13,018
[SPEAKER_00]: But citta, like, that's, let's say, you know, you have your external environment, like, you know, what's happening around you in the world, and then you have your internal environment, which is your citta.

114
00:12:14,171 --> 00:12:23,897
[SPEAKER_00]: And your actions by mano will influence that internal environment as well, your citta, just like it can influence your external environment.

115
00:12:24,478 --> 00:12:30,241
[SPEAKER_00]: But, like I said, to some extent, that internal environment is not completely in your control.

116
00:12:30,421 --> 00:12:40,007
[SPEAKER_00]: Like it's... sometimes you will have to... the most, sort of, direct obstacle to samādhi is lack of seclusion.

117
00:12:40,387 --> 00:12:42,949
[SPEAKER_00]: And even if everything else is perfectly

118
