130
00:13:54,552 --> 00:14:04,198
[SPEAKER_00]: But no, it's... the inclination is there, but you always have like a second step there, that you yourself make in relation to that inclination.

131
00:14:04,618 --> 00:14:06,039
[SPEAKER_00]: And see, it's the same principle

132
00:14:07,039 --> 00:14:16,326
[SPEAKER_00]: As with bodily and verbal action, you don't cut your hands off so that you can't steal anymore.

133
00:14:17,027 --> 00:14:21,210
[SPEAKER_00]: A bhikkhu doesn't castrate himself so that he doesn't engage in celibacy.

134
00:14:21,810 --> 00:14:28,996
[SPEAKER_00]: You don't, you know, cut your tongue off so that you can't lie and, you know, have harsh speech.

135
00:14:29,516 --> 00:14:31,878
[SPEAKER_00]: You simply don't do it, even though the possibilities

136
00:14:34,005 --> 00:14:38,089
[SPEAKER_00]: And, it's exactly the same principle on a mental level, just that, obviously, it's much more subtle.

137
00:14:38,789 --> 00:14:54,003
[SPEAKER_00]: You have the possibility to engage in the sensual desire, because your mind is in a state of sensual desire, that internal environment is there, but you choosing to then, eh... attend to sensual objects through that sensual desire, that's, that's, eh... that's your own choice.

138
00:14:54,543 --> 00:14:56,105
[SPEAKER_01]: And that is where it all starts.

139
00:14:56,125 --> 00:14:56,926
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, exactly.

140
00:14:57,766 --> 00:14:58,387
[SPEAKER_01]: So, eh...

141
00:15:02,467 --> 00:15:14,814
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, and if you're in seclusion and everything, well, you wouldn't even be able to tell what action by Mano is if you haven't developed the graduate training in seclusion.

142
00:15:26,495 --> 00:15:32,644
[SPEAKER_00]: It would just be all a jumble, and you would think you're purifying Mano, when in reality you're just trying to get rid of your citta, and so on.

143
00:15:33,405 --> 00:15:42,318
[SPEAKER_00]: But then, when you have that recognition, then maintaining that purity of Mano will, in return,

144
00:15:42,692 --> 00:15:43,653
[SPEAKER_00]: Calm down the citta.

145
00:15:43,793 --> 00:15:44,893
[SPEAKER_00]: But that's always temporary.

146
00:15:45,354 --> 00:15:45,594
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

147
00:15:45,894 --> 00:15:48,756
[SPEAKER_01]: So, now, somebody finds...

148
00:15:48,796 --> 00:15:51,177
[SPEAKER_01]: So, suppose somebody has some understanding of this distinction.

149
00:15:51,677 --> 00:16:00,162
[SPEAKER_01]: They see citta is affected by sensuality, but now, simultaneously, there's also a sensual thought present, which is on the mano level.

150
00:16:01,103 --> 00:16:01,483
