344
00:33:30,316 --> 00:33:45,903
[SPEAKER_00]: So, eh... underlying tendency has been actually removed when, no matter what happens to that internal environment, in the same way as the external environment doesn't disturb you, well, that wouldn't disturb you either, because you fully understood that the five aggregates are not yours.

