00:33:46,183 --> 00:33:54,447
[SPEAKER_00]: And, the qualification to make as well is, eh... any of the actions that happen on the

346
00:33:57,842 --> 00:34:13,877
[SPEAKER_00]: You see, all the things that, so to say, an arahant is incapable of, those things would be inconceivable, even though the mental state that, for an ordinary person, would have led to them, can still be there in its sort of outlines, as I said.

347
00:34:15,378 --> 00:34:20,303
[SPEAKER_00]: So, just to clear up that people don't think like an arahant would go around doing whatever they want, because...

