351
00:34:45,861 --> 00:34:59,372
[SPEAKER_00]: But everything in between, like, you know, when the suttas would say, kind of, sometimes, some arahants wouldn't be recognized in the suttas, like, on account of, oh, because he was associating with bad families or whatever.

